cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: batterway
abstract: >-
  A small Python package for modelling the life-cycle inventory (LCI) of lithium-ion
  battery recycling. It loads battery bills-of-materials and recycling-route flow ratios
  from CSV data and computes the material in- and out-flows of a recycling process for a
  given quantity of end-of-life battery. A prototype built at the 2024 Départ de Sentier
  autumn school; the mass balance does not close.
